  "description": "Package updates archived out of PuppetDB by puppetdb_patch_history. Everything reads the patch_history.patch_event view, which resolves patching_as_code's `ensure => latest` back to the version actually installed. Panels are bounded by the dashboard time range on run_at, and by the Node, Package and Status filters.",
