    {
      "datasource": { "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource", "uid": "puppetdb-patch-history" },
      "description": "The archive, newest first, capped at 500 rows - narrow the time range or the filters rather than raising the limit. 'To' is effective_version: the version parsed from the agent's message, falling back to the catalog's value when there is no message to parse. 'absent' means the package was installed or removed, and a comma-separated list is a provider offering several candidate versions.",
